  factionEliminationNarratives:
  - factionId: avalon
    title:
      uid: FALL_AVALON_TITLE
      korean: "\uBCC4\uBE5B \uC655\uAD00\uC758 \uCD94\uB77D"
      english: Fall of the Starlit Crown
    description:
      uid: FALL_AVALON_DESC
      korean: "\uC655\uAD6D\uC758 \uAE43\uBC1C\uC774 \uB9C8\uC9C0\uB9C9 \uC131\uBCBD\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uB0B4\uB824\uC654\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: The royal banner falls from its final wall.
  - factionId: valdor
    title:
      uid: FALL_VALDOR_TITLE
      korean: "\uBD89\uC740 \uAD70\uB2E8\uC758 \uD574\uC0B0"
      english: Dissolution of the Red Legions
    description:
      uid: FALL_VALDOR_DESC
      korean: "\uC81C\uAD6D\uC758 \uAD70\uB2E8\uC740 \uC9C0\uD718\uD560 \uC601\uD1A0\uB97C
        \uC783\uACE0 \uD769\uC5B4\uC84C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: The imperial legions scatter without territory to command.
  - factionId: ironheart
    title:
      uid: FALL_IRONHEART_TITLE
      korean: "\uB9C8\uC9C0\uB9C9 \uC6A9\uAD11\uB85C\uC758 \uCE68\uBB35"
      english: Silence of the Last Forge
    description:
      uid: FALL_IRONHEART_DESC
      korean: "\uC0B0\uB9E5\uC758 \uB9C8\uC9C0\uB9C9 \uB300\uC6A9\uAD11\uB85C\uAC00
        \uBD88\uAF43\uC744 \uC783\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: The final great forge in the mountains has gone dark.
  - factionId: sylvanroad
    title:
      uid: FALL_SYLVAN_TITLE
      korean: "\uC232\uAE38 \uC218\uD638\uB9F9\uC758 \uD574\uCCB4"
      english: End of the Woodland Pact
    description:
      uid: FALL_SYLVAN_DESC
      korean: "\uC624\uB798\uB41C \uC232\uAE38\uC758 \uC218\uD638 \uB9F9\uC138\uAC00
        \uAC01 \uBD80\uC871\uC73C\uB85C \uD769\uC5B4\uC84C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: The old woodland oath dissolves among the tribes.
  - factionId: necropolis
    title:
      uid: FALL_NECRO_TITLE
      korean: "\uB9DD\uC790\uC758 \uC655\uC88C \uBD09\uC778"
      english: Sealing of the Deathless Throne
    description:
      uid: FALL_NECRO_DESC
      korean: "\uC8FD\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB294 \uC655\uC88C\uAC00 \uBD09\uC778\uB418\uACE0
        \uBB18\uC2E4\uC758 \uAD70\uC138\uAC00 \uC7A0\uB4E4\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: The deathless throne is sealed and the crypt legions sleep.
  campaignEndings:
  - endingType: 1
    title:
      uid: ENDING_CONCORD_TITLE
      korean: "\uBCC4\uBE5B \uC544\uB798\uC758 \uD654\uD569"
      english: Concord Beneath the Starlight
    description:
      uid: ENDING_CONCORD_DESC
      korean: "\uC544\uBC1C\uB860\uC740 \uC815\uBCF5\uD55C \uB545\uC758 \uC8FC\uBBFC\uACFC
        \uC804\uD1B5\uC744 \uBC1B\uC544\uB4E4\uC774\uBA70 \uB300\uB959\uC744 \uD558\uB098\uC758
        \uC5F0\uB9F9\uC73C\uB85C \uBB36\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC804\uC7C1\uC740
        \uB05D\uB0AC\uACE0 \uAC01 \uC9C0\uC5ED\uC758 \uBAA9\uC18C\uB9AC\uAC00 \uC0C8
        \uC655\uAD6D\uC758 \uD3C9\uC815\uC5D0 \uCC38\uC5EC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: Avalon embraced the peoples and traditions of conquered lands and
        united the continent as a concord. The war is over and every region has a
        voice in the new realm.
  - endingType: 2
    title:
      uid: ENDING_DOMINION_TITLE
      korean: "\uCCA0\uC758 \uC655\uAD00 \uC544\uB798"
      english: Beneath the Iron Crown
    description:
      uid: ENDING_DOMINION_DESC
      korean: "\uC544\uBC1C\uB860\uC740 \uAD70\uC815\uACFC \uC131\uBCBD\uC758 \uC9C8\uC11C\uB85C
        \uB300\uB959\uC744 \uD1B5\uC77C\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC804\uC7C1\uC740
        \uB05D\uB0AC\uC9C0\uB9CC \uC0C8 \uC655\uAD6D\uC758 \uD3C9\uD654\uB294 \uAC15\uD55C
        \uAD70\uB2E8\uACFC \uC655\uBA85\uC758 \uBB34\uAC8C \uC704\uC5D0 \uC11C \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: Avalon unified the continent through martial rule and fortified order.
        The war is over but peace now rests upon powerful legions and royal command.
  campaignVariants:
  - variant: 0
    displayName:
      uid: VARIANT_CLASSIC_NAME
      korean: "\uC815\uD1B5 \uC7AC\uAC74"
      english: Classic Restoration
    description:
      uid: VARIANT_CLASSIC_DESC
      korean: "\uC544\uBC1C\uB860 \uC131 \uD55C \uACF3\uACFC \uC544\uB808\uC2A4\xB7\uC54C\uB374\uC758
        \uC2E0\uB8B0\uB85C \uC2DC\uC791\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: Begin with Avalon Castle and the trust of Ares and Alden.
    additionalPlayerCastleId: 
    relationshipFirstHeroId: 
    relationshipSecondHeroId: 
    relationshipLevel: 1
  - variant: 1
    displayName:
      uid: VARIANT_BORDER_NAME
      korean: "\uAD6D\uACBD \uC218\uBE44\uB300"
      english: Border Garrison
    description:
      uid: VARIANT_BORDER_DESC
      korean: "\uBD89\uC740 \uAD00\uBB38\uC744 \uC120\uC810\uD574 \uC544\uBC1C\uB860
        \uC601\uD1A0 2\uC131\uC73C\uB85C \uC2DC\uC791\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: Begin with the Red Gate secured and two Avalon castles.
    additionalPlayerCastleId: castle_01
    relationshipFirstHeroId: 
    relationshipSecondHeroId: 
    relationshipLevel: 1
  - variant: 2
    displayName:
      uid: VARIANT_COURT_NAME
      korean: "\uBD84\uC5F4\uB41C \uAD81\uC815"
      english: Divided Court
    description:
      uid: VARIANT_COURT_DESC
      korean: "\uC544\uB808\uC2A4\uC640 \uC54C\uB374\uC758 \uAD00\uACC4\uAC00 \uAC08\uB4F1\uC73C\uB85C
        \uBC14\uB010 \uCC44 \uC218\uB3C4 \uC7AC\uAC74\uC744 \uC2DC\uC791\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      english: Restore the capital while Ares and Alden begin in conflict.
    additionalPlayerCastleId: 
    relationshipFirstHeroId: ares
    relationshipSecondHeroId: common_alden
    relationshipLevel: 0
  heroLegacyDefinitions:
  - id: legacy_prosperity
    projectType: 0
